# Personal main-card header (LOCKED — global)

When creating or restyling a **Personal main-card title** (icon + label), use the lock in
`src/Products/PinoyBusinessPOS/ExItS.PinoyBusinessPOS.React/src/features/ui-standards/personal-main-card-header-global-default.ts`.

The locked command is `ext personal main-card-header icon-round label`.

CSS: `src/Products/PinoyBusinessPOS/ExItS.PinoyBusinessPOS.React/src/styles/personal-main-card-header.css`

## Recipe (one spot)

- Icon disc: `PERSONAL_MAIN_CARD_HEADER_ICON_SIZE` (**2rem**), fully rounded (`999px`)
- Mark: `PERSONAL_MAIN_CARD_HEADER_ICON_MARK` (**1.05rem**), white
- Fill: solid identity chip + soft radial highlight (same light + dark — do **not** mute the chip in dark)
- No border on the disc
- Label: **1.05rem** / **700** / line-height **1.2** / letter-spacing **-0.01em**
- Gap icon↔label: **0.55rem**
- Light label: black **28%** into chip; dark label: `#f1f5f9`

## Color policy (LOCKED)

Each card **keeps** its identity chip via `--personal-main-card-header-chip`:

| Card | Chip |
| --- | --- |
| Stores to pay | `var(--exits-primary)` (home primary row) |
| Recent activity | `var(--exits-primary)` (home primary row) |
| Needs Attention | `#ff5722` |
| Quick actions | `#ff5722` |
| To-do | `var(--exits-primary)` (home primary row) |
| Personal Tracker | `#22c55e` (or `--personal-tracker-accent`) |
| People list | `#4169e1` |
| Money I owe plain | `var(--exits-primary)` |

Do **not** invent a different header icon size, radius, or label type per card. Change tokens in the lock file + CSS together.

## Markup

Reuse existing `*__title` + `*__pennant` + `*__pennant-icon` class names — the shared CSS targets them. New Personal main cards must use the same class pattern (or extend the shared selector list).

Change this lock only when the user asks. Update `personal-main-card-header-global-default.ts`, `personal-main-card-header-global-default.test.ts`, `personal-main-card-header.css`, and this rule together.
